{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Static prerendering is the process of generating static HTML files for your application. This can be useful for either improving the performance of your application, as it allows you to serve pre-rendered HTML files to users without having to generate them on the fly or for deploying static sites to platforms that do not support server-side rendering."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"prerendering","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prerendering"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Start can prerender your application to static HTML files, which can then be served to users without having to generate them on the fly. To prerender your application, you can add the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"prerender"},{"type":"text","value":" option to your "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstackStart"},{"type":"text","value":" configuration:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tabs","attributes":{"variant":"bundler"},"children":[{"type":"component","name":"tab-panel","tagName":"md-tab-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-tab-slug":"vite","data-tab-index":"0","data-content":"code-only"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport { tanstackStart } from '@tanstack/react-start/plugin/vite'\nimport viteReact from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackStart({\n      prerender: {\n        // Switch to true to enable prerendering\n        enabled: false,\n\n        // Disable if you need pages to be at `/page.html` instead of `/page/index.html`\n        autoSubfolderIndex: true,\n\n        // If disabled, only the root path or the paths defined in the pages config will be prerendered\n        autoStaticPathsDiscovery: true,\n\n        // How many prerender jobs to run at once\n        concurrency: 14,\n\n        // Whether to extract links from the HTML and prerender them also\n        crawlLinks: true,\n\n        // Filter function takes the page object and returns whether it should prerender\n        filter: ({ path }) => !path.startsWith('/do-not-render-me'),\n\n        // Number of times to retry a failed prerender job\n        retryCount: 2,\n\n        // Delay between retries in milliseconds\n        retryDelay: 1000,\n\n        // Maximum number of redirects to follow during prerendering\n        maxRedirects: 5,\n\n        // Fail if an error occurs during prerendering\n        failOnError: true,\n\n        // Callback when page is successfully rendered\n        onSuccess: ({ page }) => {\n          console.log(`Rendered ${page.path}!`)\n        },\n      },\n      // Optional configuration for specific pages\n      // Note: When autoStaticPathsDiscovery is enabled (default), discovered static\n      // routes will be merged with the pages specified below\n      pages: [\n        {\n          path: '/my-page',\n          prerender: { enabled: true, outputPath: '/my-page/index.html' },\n        },\n      ],\n    }),\n    viteReact(),\n  ],\n})","lang":"ts","meta":"title=\"vite.config.ts\"","title":"vite.config.ts","file":"vite.config.ts"}]},{"type":"component","name":"tab-panel","tagName":"md-tab-panel","attributes":{},"properties":{"data-tab-slug":"rsbuild","data-tab-index":"1","data-content":"code-only"},"children":[{"type":"code","value":"import { defineConfig } from '@rsbuild/core'\nimport { pluginReact } from '@rsbuild/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackStart } from '@tanstack/react-start/plugin/rsbuild'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    pluginReact(),\n    tanstackStart({\n      prerender: {\n        // Switch to true to enable prerendering\n        enabled: false,\n\n        // Disable if you need pages to be at `/page.html` instead of `/page/index.html`\n        autoSubfolderIndex: true,\n\n        // If disabled, only the root path or the paths defined in the pages config will be prerendered\n        autoStaticPathsDiscovery: true,\n\n        // How many prerender jobs to run at once\n        concurrency: 14,\n\n        // Whether to extract links from the HTML and prerender them also\n        crawlLinks: true,\n\n        // Filter function takes the page object and returns whether it should prerender\n        filter: ({ path }) => !path.startsWith('/do-not-render-me'),\n\n        // Number of times to retry a failed prerender job\n        retryCount: 2,\n\n        // Delay between retries in milliseconds\n        retryDelay: 1000,\n\n        // Maximum number of redirects to follow during prerendering\n        maxRedirects: 5,\n\n        // Fail if an error occurs during prerendering\n        failOnError: true,\n\n        // Callback when page is successfully rendered\n        onSuccess: ({ page }) => {\n          console.log(`Rendered ${page.path}!`)\n        },\n      },\n      // Optional configuration for specific pages\n      // Note: When autoStaticPathsDiscovery is enabled (default), discovered static\n      // routes will be merged with the pages specified below\n      pages: [\n        {\n          path: '/my-page',\n          prerender: { enabled: true, outputPath: '/my-page/index.html' },\n        },\n      ],\n    }),\n  ],\n})","lang":"ts","meta":"title=\"rsbuild.config.ts\"","title":"rsbuild.config.ts","file":"rsbuild.config.ts"}]}],"properties":{"data-attributes":"{\"tabs\":[{\"slug\":\"vite\",\"name\":\"vite\"},{\"slug\":\"rsbuild\",\"name\":\"rsbuild\"}]}","data-bundler-meta":"{\"bundlers\":[\"vite\",\"rsbuild\"]}"}},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"automatic-static-route-discovery","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Automatic Static Route Discovery"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All static paths will be automatically discovered and seamlessly merged with the specified "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pages"},{"type":"text","value":" config"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Routes are excluded from automatic discovery in the following cases:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Routes with path parameters (e.g., "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/users/$userId"},{"type":"text","value":") since they require specific parameter values"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Layout routes (prefixed with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"_"},{"type":"text","value":") since they don't render standalone pages"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Routes without components (e.g., API routes)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note: Dynamic routes can still be prerendered if they are linked from other pages when "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"crawlLinks"},{"type":"text","value":" is enabled."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"crawling-links","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Crawling Links"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"crawlLinks"},{"type":"text","value":" is enabled (default: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"true"},{"type":"text","value":"), TanStack Start will extract links from prerendered pages and prerender those linked pages as well."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For example, if "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/"},{"type":"text","value":" contains a link to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/posts"},{"type":"text","value":", then "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"/posts"},{"type":"text","value":" will also be automatically prerendered."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"prerendering","text":"Prerendering","level":2},{"id":"automatic-static-route-discovery","text":"Automatic Static Route Discovery","level":2},{"id":"crawling-links","text":"Crawling Links","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nStatic prerendering is the process of generating static HTML files for your application. This can be useful for either improving the performance of your application, as it allows you to serve pre-rendered HTML files to users without having to generate them on the fly or for deploying static sites to platforms that do not support server-side rendering.\n\n## Prerendering\n\nTanStack Start can prerender your application to static HTML files, which can then be served to users without having to generate them on the fly. To prerender your application, you can add the `prerender` option to your `tanstackStart` configuration:\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"bundler\" -->\n\n# Vite\n\n```ts title=\"vite.config.ts\"\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport { tanstackStart } from '@tanstack/react-start/plugin/vite'\nimport viteReact from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackStart({\n      prerender: {\n        // Switch to true to enable prerendering\n        enabled: false,\n\n        // Disable if you need pages to be at `/page.html` instead of `/page/index.html`\n        autoSubfolderIndex: true,\n\n        // If disabled, only the root path or the paths defined in the pages config will be prerendered\n        autoStaticPathsDiscovery: true,\n\n        // How many prerender jobs to run at once\n        concurrency: 14,\n\n        // Whether to extract links from the HTML and prerender them also\n        crawlLinks: true,\n\n        // Filter function takes the page object and returns whether it should prerender\n        filter: ({ path }) => !path.startsWith('/do-not-render-me'),\n\n        // Number of times to retry a failed prerender job\n        retryCount: 2,\n\n        // Delay between retries in milliseconds\n        retryDelay: 1000,\n\n        // Maximum number of redirects to follow during prerendering\n        maxRedirects: 5,\n\n        // Fail if an error occurs during prerendering\n        failOnError: true,\n\n        // Callback when page is successfully rendered\n        onSuccess: ({ page }) => {\n          console.log(`Rendered ${page.path}!`)\n        },\n      },\n      // Optional configuration for specific pages\n      // Note: When autoStaticPathsDiscovery is enabled (default), discovered static\n      // routes will be merged with the pages specified below\n      pages: [\n        {\n          path: '/my-page',\n          prerender: { enabled: true, outputPath: '/my-page/index.html' },\n        },\n      ],\n    }),\n    viteReact(),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n# Rsbuild\n\n```ts title=\"rsbuild.config.ts\"\nimport { defineConfig } from '@rsbuild/core'\nimport { pluginReact } from '@rsbuild/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackStart } from '@tanstack/react-start/plugin/rsbuild'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    pluginReact(),\n    tanstackStart({\n      prerender: {\n        // Switch to true to enable prerendering\n        enabled: false,\n\n        // Disable if you need pages to be at `/page.html` instead of `/page/index.html`\n        autoSubfolderIndex: true,\n\n        // If disabled, only the root path or the paths defined in the pages config will be prerendered\n        autoStaticPathsDiscovery: true,\n\n        // How many prerender jobs to run at once\n        concurrency: 14,\n\n        // Whether to extract links from the HTML and prerender them also\n        crawlLinks: true,\n\n        // Filter function takes the page object and returns whether it should prerender\n        filter: ({ path }) => !path.startsWith('/do-not-render-me'),\n\n        // Number of times to retry a failed prerender job\n        retryCount: 2,\n\n        // Delay between retries in milliseconds\n        retryDelay: 1000,\n\n        // Maximum number of redirects to follow during prerendering\n        maxRedirects: 5,\n\n        // Fail if an error occurs during prerendering\n        failOnError: true,\n\n        // Callback when page is successfully rendered\n        onSuccess: ({ page }) => {\n          console.log(`Rendered ${page.path}!`)\n        },\n      },\n      // Optional configuration for specific pages\n      // Note: When autoStaticPathsDiscovery is enabled (default), discovered static\n      // routes will be merged with the pages specified below\n      pages: [\n        {\n          path: '/my-page',\n          prerender: { enabled: true, outputPath: '/my-page/index.html' },\n        },\n      ],\n    }),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Automatic Static Route Discovery\n\nAll static paths will be automatically discovered and seamlessly merged with the specified `pages` config\n\nRoutes are excluded from automatic discovery in the following cases:\n\n- Routes with path parameters (e.g., `/users/$userId`) since they require specific parameter values\n- Layout routes (prefixed with `_`) since they don't render standalone pages\n- Routes without components (e.g., API routes)\n\nNote: Dynamic routes can still be prerendered if they are linked from other pages when `crawlLinks` is enabled.\n\n## Crawling Links\n\nWhen `crawlLinks` is enabled (default: `true`), TanStack Start will extract links from prerendered pages and prerender those linked pages as well.\n\nFor example, if `/` contains a link to `/posts`, then `/posts` will also be automatically prerendered.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: static-prerendering\ntitle: Static Prerendering\n---\n\nStatic prerendering is the process of generating static HTML files for your application. This can be useful for either improving the performance of your application, as it allows you to serve pre-rendered HTML files to users without having to generate them on the fly or for deploying static sites to platforms that do not support server-side rendering.\n\n## Prerendering\n\nTanStack Start can prerender your application to static HTML files, which can then be served to users without having to generate them on the fly. To prerender your application, you can add the `prerender` option to your `tanstackStart` configuration:\n\n<!-- ::start:tabs variant=\"bundler\" -->\n\n# Vite\n\n```ts title=\"vite.config.ts\"\nimport { defineConfig } from 'vite'\nimport { tanstackStart } from '@tanstack/react-start/plugin/vite'\nimport viteReact from '@vitejs/plugin-react'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    tanstackStart({\n      prerender: {\n        // Switch to true to enable prerendering\n        enabled: false,\n\n        // Disable if you need pages to be at `/page.html` instead of `/page/index.html`\n        autoSubfolderIndex: true,\n\n        // If disabled, only the root path or the paths defined in the pages config will be prerendered\n        autoStaticPathsDiscovery: true,\n\n        // How many prerender jobs to run at once\n        concurrency: 14,\n\n        // Whether to extract links from the HTML and prerender them also\n        crawlLinks: true,\n\n        // Filter function takes the page object and returns whether it should prerender\n        filter: ({ path }) => !path.startsWith('/do-not-render-me'),\n\n        // Number of times to retry a failed prerender job\n        retryCount: 2,\n\n        // Delay between retries in milliseconds\n        retryDelay: 1000,\n\n        // Maximum number of redirects to follow during prerendering\n        maxRedirects: 5,\n\n        // Fail if an error occurs during prerendering\n        failOnError: true,\n\n        // Callback when page is successfully rendered\n        onSuccess: ({ page }) => {\n          console.log(`Rendered ${page.path}!`)\n        },\n      },\n      // Optional configuration for specific pages\n      // Note: When autoStaticPathsDiscovery is enabled (default), discovered static\n      // routes will be merged with the pages specified below\n      pages: [\n        {\n          path: '/my-page',\n          prerender: { enabled: true, outputPath: '/my-page/index.html' },\n        },\n      ],\n    }),\n    viteReact(),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n# Rsbuild\n\n```ts title=\"rsbuild.config.ts\"\nimport { defineConfig } from '@rsbuild/core'\nimport { pluginReact } from '@rsbuild/plugin-react'\nimport { tanstackStart } from '@tanstack/react-start/plugin/rsbuild'\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [\n    pluginReact(),\n    tanstackStart({\n      prerender: {\n        // Switch to true to enable prerendering\n        enabled: false,\n\n        // Disable if you need pages to be at `/page.html` instead of `/page/index.html`\n        autoSubfolderIndex: true,\n\n        // If disabled, only the root path or the paths defined in the pages config will be prerendered\n        autoStaticPathsDiscovery: true,\n\n        // How many prerender jobs to run at once\n        concurrency: 14,\n\n        // Whether to extract links from the HTML and prerender them also\n        crawlLinks: true,\n\n        // Filter function takes the page object and returns whether it should prerender\n        filter: ({ path }) => !path.startsWith('/do-not-render-me'),\n\n        // Number of times to retry a failed prerender job\n        retryCount: 2,\n\n        // Delay between retries in milliseconds\n        retryDelay: 1000,\n\n        // Maximum number of redirects to follow during prerendering\n        maxRedirects: 5,\n\n        // Fail if an error occurs during prerendering\n        failOnError: true,\n\n        // Callback when page is successfully rendered\n        onSuccess: ({ page }) => {\n          console.log(`Rendered ${page.path}!`)\n        },\n      },\n      // Optional configuration for specific pages\n      // Note: When autoStaticPathsDiscovery is enabled (default), discovered static\n      // routes will be merged with the pages specified below\n      pages: [\n        {\n          path: '/my-page',\n          prerender: { enabled: true, outputPath: '/my-page/index.html' },\n        },\n      ],\n    }),\n  ],\n})\n```\n\n<!-- ::end:tabs -->\n\n## Automatic Static Route Discovery\n\nAll static paths will be automatically discovered and seamlessly merged with the specified `pages` config\n\nRoutes are excluded from automatic discovery in the following cases:\n\n- Routes with path parameters (e.g., `/users/$userId`) since they require specific parameter values\n- Layout routes (prefixed with `_`) since they don't render standalone pages\n- Routes without components (e.g., API routes)\n\nNote: Dynamic routes can still be prerendered if they are linked from other pages when `crawlLinks` is enabled.\n\n## Crawling Links\n\nWhen `crawlLinks` is enabled (default: `true`), TanStack Start will extract links from prerendered pages and prerender those linked pages as well.\n\nFor example, if `/` contains a link to `/posts`, then `/posts` will also be automatically prerendered.\n"}
